      <Docs>
        <summary>
          <para>Tokenization for emails. This value indicates that tokens should be extracted from this property based on email structure. For example, a property with "alex.sav@google.com" will produce tokens for "alex", "sav", "alex.sav", "google", "com", and "alexsav@google.com" It is only valid for tokenizer_type to be 'RFC822' if getIndexingType() is INDEXING_TYPE_EXACT_TERMS or INDEXING_TYPE_PREFIXES.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/app/appsearch/AppSearchSchema.StringPropertyConfig#TOKENIZER_TYPE_RFC822" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.app.appsearch.AppSearchSchema.StringPropertyConfig.TOKENIZER_TYPE_RFC822</code>.</a></format></para>
